{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110420001:1":{"text":"族長に傷を負わせたお前たちを、ここから先に通すわけにはいかない。","source_cn":"诸位打伤了我们的族长，恕我不能让你们通过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94210D4B03C58917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110420002:1":{"text":"オルグは自業自得だ。向こうから仕掛けたくせに、負けて負傷したらオレらのせいにするのか？","source_cn":"奥格是咎由自取。是他主动发难，战败负伤，这难道还能怪我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8311B099CE42895D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110420003:1":{"text":"お前がソーンだな。もっと早く気付くべきだった。","source_cn":"看来你就是索恩。我早该注意到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1BC84F78A5E41BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110420004:1":{"text":"そっちにも言い分はあるだろうが、兄貴の率いるブラックロアーでは、その道理は通じない。","source_cn":"我相信你有自己的道理，但道理在我哥哥率领的黑嚎是行不通的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04507A1C44928117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110420004":{"text":"そっちにも言い分はあるだろうが、兄貴の率いるブラックロアーでは、その道理は通じない。","source_cn":"我相信你有自己的道理，但道理在我哥哥率领的黑嚎是行不通的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04507A1C44928117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110420006:1":{"text":"俺たちは偉大な血脈で繋がっているのだ。","source_cn":"伟大的血脉将我们连接在一起。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xABBF0545274A6E65","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"俺たちは偉大な血脈で繋がっているのだ。","female":"俺たちは偉大な血脈で繋がっているのだ。","variant_male_record_index":"122590","variant_female_record_index":"122591","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110420007:1":{"text":"でも、いきなり戦わずに、こうしてちゃんと話しをしてくれるってことは……","source_cn":"但是，你能跟我们对话，而不是直接战斗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE427015992C4688A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110420008:1":{"text":"オルグさんの考えに少なからず疑問を持ってるんじゃないの？","source_cn":"你，并不完全认同奥格的想法吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x288D1A25CCE8E013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110420009:1":{"text":"そんなことは一言も言っていない。俺は兄貴であり、族長であるオルグに忠誠を誓っている。","source_cn":"我从没说过那样的话。我忠于奥格——作为血亲，也作为族人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB131AD9647D0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110420010:1":{"text":"お前たちの足止めをしろと言われたからそれに従った。だが同時に……","source_cn":"他命令我拦住你们，现在我拦住了。但同时——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96E7ED951A61CB62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110420011:1":{"text":"俺も戦士の端くれ。ブラックロアーの戦士たる者、強者を前に血が滾らずにいられようか！","source_cn":"我也是一名战士。真正的黑嚎战士，面对勇士，绝不会无动于衷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CE51C583B6CCFFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110420012:1":{"text":"では、始めよう。実力勝負で俺に勝てたら、ここを通してやる！","source_cn":"那么，战斗吧。如果你们能堂堂正正赢了我，我就放你们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1791C37C3EEDE0D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"オルグの弟なのか？","source_cn":"奥格是你的哥哥？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3014808981BD1983","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"オルグの弟なのか？","female":"オルグの弟なの？","variant_male_record_index":"63682","variant_female_record_index":"63683","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110420005:1":{"text":"俺とオルグは間違いなくブラックロアーの血を引く実の兄弟だ。","source_cn":"我们确实是黑嚎一脉相承的亲兄弟。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0585C80A0C2C3B67","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"俺とオルグは間違いなくブラックロアーの血を引く実の兄弟だ。","female":"俺とオルグは間違いなくブラックロアーの血を引く実の兄弟だ。","variant_male_record_index":"122588","variant_female_record_index":"122589","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"オルグとあまり似てないんだな。","source_cn":"你和奥格长得似乎不太像","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA25840394DA120","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"オルグとあまり似てな